WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.890
- Is it true that your time off

00:00:01.890 --> 00:00:04.683
you also took a class
on hostage negotiation?

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:07.350
We would vacation well together.

00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:08.183
- [Lauren] We would for sure.

00:00:08.183 --> 00:00:09.300
- I'd be like, sure.

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:11.820
- I belong to Masterclass.

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:15.270
You know the thing, you can
subscribe to Masterclass.

00:00:15.270 --> 00:00:17.610
And it's all these experts on everything.

00:00:17.610 --> 00:00:18.443
- Wait, what?

00:00:18.443 --> 00:00:20.520
- And so I try to take something

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:23.010
that I wouldn't normally
use in daily life.

00:00:23.010 --> 00:00:25.263
And one of them was hostage negotiating.

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:27.840
- But hopefully it doesn't come in handy.

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:29.280
- I hope not.

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:31.260
But I'm a handy person to have

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:34.440
if things go wrong on our summer vacation.

00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:35.850
So I took hostage negotiating.

00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:38.130
I took tortilla making.

00:00:38.130 --> 00:00:39.780
I just try to take random stuff.

00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:41.520
- I don't know this,
so I need to know this.

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:42.540
- It's really fun.

00:00:42.540 --> 00:00:44.850
And the guy who teaches
hostage negotiating

00:00:44.850 --> 00:00:46.873
is exactly who you'd cast to teach.

00:00:46.873 --> 00:00:49.710
He's like, listen, this
is what you gotta do

00:00:49.710 --> 00:00:52.200
when you're trying to talk
him down off the hill.

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:53.310
I don't know why we're on a hill.

00:00:53.310 --> 00:00:54.780
- Off the hill?

00:00:54.780 --> 00:00:55.704
Not a building.

00:00:55.704 --> 00:00:58.230
(laughs)

00:00:58.230 --> 00:00:59.550
- Don't jump off the hill.

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:02.553
- I've been taken hostage
in the fields of Montana.

